<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.10 vs   2.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.03 vs   4.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.55 vs   6.22</p>
<p> Sales		  111.44 vs  92.94</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.37 vs  18.68</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.59 vs  27.94</p>
<p> Operating profit    32.14 vs  46.43</p>
<p> Sales		  830.20 vs 728.51</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader and producer is</p>
<p>Rolimpex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
